{"lines":[{"x":0.60677388890611172,"h":0.022092273294293863,"c":1,"y":0.059811457263925005,"t":"Sample answers for Writing tasks","w":0.32144193013509115},{"w":0.36419754028320311,"y":0.10600706668028825,"x":0.086419748183456588,"c":1,"t":"TEST 6, WRITING TASK 2","h":0.024806886455055133},{"x":0.086419750818830132,"h":0.017452132715914948,"c":1,"y":0.14244186028855765,"w":0.20781893412272134,"t":"SAMPLE ANSWER"},{"w":0.8047105407714843,"h":0.021011547991749202,"c":1,"x":0.084267453397855741,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 5.0 score. Here is the","y":0.17966863700518521},{"y":0.19611307442376535,"t":"examiner's comment:","x":0.084362139650291823,"h":0.019140164899882239,"c":1,"w":0.20987654368082681},{"x":0.13168724232962642,"w":0.72427983601888002,"h":0.018933012010913575,"y":0.23401162829478506,"c":1,"t":"The response looks at some advantages and disadvantages of the topic, but"},{"h":0.025945189423218551,"y":0.24740306239287646,"w":0.76589029947916654,"x":0.12943033447558994,"c":1,"t":"does not reach any conclusion. As a result, there is a lack of overall progression,"},{"x":0.12956060334946953,"y":0.26907092304985636,"w":0.7449910990397135,"c":1,"h":0.019092677760039978,"t":"although organisation is evident and cohesive devices are used (though rather"},{"w":0.75941996256510413,"h":0.020954345505425742,"t":"mechanically) [One of advantages | For example | Also | Another disadvantage |","x":0.12955461607780022,"c":1,"y":0.28721818199553284},{"y":0.30469676302778859,"t":"For instance]. The range of lexis is adequate for the task, however there are often","x":0.12951851309079815,"c":1,"w":0.77182495117187488,"h":0.021736077622052985},{"t":"spelling mistakes [contries | yonge | quilified] and errors in word choice or formation","x":0.12954690780201494,"y":0.32204349949428834,"c":1,"w":0.78823582967122396,"h":0.020776901424843897},{"h":0.023954732960048242,"w":0.72260289510091147,"t":"[chancing to improve | unemployee problem]. There are attempts to produce","x":0.12737386015880645,"y":0.33813827416870512,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.12962962010602297,"w":0.72839508056640634,"y":0.36042402838343124,"h":0.016029460129664885,"t":"complex sentence forms, but there is a lack of grammatical control which can"},{"y":0.37378101539496589,"x":0.12946098672057871,"w":0.79251195271809893,"c":1,"h":0.023247623331274392,"t":"cause some difficulty for the reader [... due to some countries limit the population, if"},{"w":0.44855967203776048,"h":0.016017476296396826,"c":1,"y":0.39534883706154678,"x":0.12757201571959301,"t":"that have more young children it will over limit]."},{"x":0.080087592949497646,"t":"Nowadays, the people of some countries that have the young people more than the old","h":0.023026123765781503,"y":0.42747462357355814,"w":0.81302647908528636,"c":1},{"x":0.08010368373310485,"c":1,"y":0.44487079759682358,"w":0.82125701904296877,"t":"people. Some people thinks when their contries have the yonge people more than the old","h":0.023129120591953267},{"x":0.078189301590591259,"y":0.46511627886942453,"h":0.01751034054795475,"w":0.82098765055338541,"t":"people will be good because, that could increases the population in the future. Another","c":1},{"x":0.078129434976770634,"t":"people thinks it not good due to some countries limit the population, if that have","y":0.4823777236313066,"w":0.79230189005533869,"h":0.019022064298847674,"c":1},{"t":"more young children, it will over limit. This essay will discuss the advantages and","w":0.77590937296549478,"c":1,"h":0.01942512817742259,"x":0.080145355328566745,"y":0.49978992812565859},{"t":"disadvantages about in some countries have the young peopte more than the old people.","c":1,"h":0.021623212681782689,"w":0.81913894653320318,"x":0.07808634966151165,"y":0.51732271575549915},{"c":1,"t":"One of advantages is increasing the population. In some countries support the family","x":0.078078657500867815,"y":0.54337716487364995,"h":0.021508552722009799,"w":0.81298390706380208},{"x":0.080161179272883964,"t":"to have more children because that can increases the population in the future. For","w":0.7779310099283856,"h":0.016509325681221321,"c":1,"y":0.5614236193348785},{"c":1,"w":0.78617263793945302,"t":"example, in Singapore, Philiphine and so on. What is more chancing to improve the","y":0.57922144772354467,"x":0.078103367998270126,"h":0.020104344236555827},{"y":0.5972432669051827,"h":0.018507641813639841,"x":0.078132178989795492,"t":"educations as when they have a lot of young generation, the government could improve","c":1,"w":0.80875244140625002},{"w":0.83127568562825527,"t":"a good education. Also, they can develop the systems include the quilified teachers, the","x":0.076131701501716026,"h":0.018895348053517669,"y":0.61482558166909884,"c":1},{"x":0.077545069794179688,"y":0.63088591178129028,"w":0.16147660573323566,"t":"good atmosphere.","h":0.019167047507350099,"c":1},{"x":0.078058724489074693,"t":"One of disadvantages is the place for study. If the young generation still a lok, the","w":0.80682525634765623,"y":0.65710460689916872,"h":0.022696534371347998,"c":1},{"w":0.77160491943359377,"t":"school will not enough for the study, the government should construct more school.","x":0.076131696514092559,"y":0.67726737340169862,"c":1,"h":0.017500068610632802},{"w":0.84170516967773445,"h":0.019908132204880302,"y":0.69321462046028437,"t":"Also, when they have the new schools, the teacher will not enough to teach them. The.","x":0.067850772693846012,"c":1},{"w":0.67306096394856763,"c":1,"t":"university should get more student to study about teaching education.","x":0.073969900894597054,"h":0.02150985573992148,"y":0.71147885382335685},{"y":0.7368558375010601,"c":1,"w":0.80062810262044259,"x":0.076014535208001249,"t":"Anokher disadvantages is the quality of education. If the many students learn in the","h":0.021338540336689693},{"y":0.75251273688015596,"h":0.022291004868362552,"t":"classroom, the teachers can not take care all. For instance, when they have a problem they","w":0.83985214233398442,"c":1,"x":0.078040964451696102},{"x":0.073920905919135194,"y":0.77208344858779632,"h":0.022968024892997985,"w":0.79659927368164074,"t":"will need some help from the teachers. Furthermore, when they grow up, the unemployee","c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.073995807587702134,"h":0.020377903860786417,"y":0.79118968438475745,"w":0.74502604166666675,"t":"problem will happen because the company can not receive everybody to get a job."},{"y":0.81683171436334256,"w":0.74086395263671878,"c":1,"h":0.019653170914756712,"t":"In conclusion, in some countries that have the young population more than the old","x":0.074004039797195845},{"w":0.76350626627604168,"h":0.020108248797125805,"c":1,"y":0.83473407805136135,"x":0.074006542186925234,"t":"population, the government should manage the education system. Moreover, they should"},{"x":0.074000505051472765,"h":0.019276328025071954,"w":0.76558227539062496,"c":1,"y":0.85272411286082173,"t":"prepare the plans for sloving unemployee problems which can happen in the future."},{"c":1,"t":"127","x":0.87654321048008799,"y":0.93749999982396326,"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.037037035624186143},{"x":0.39483721299237268,"c":1,"t":"leltsresources.org","y":0.96768258536995222,"h":0.016454192297478354,"w":0.20824633280436194}],"h":3395,"w":2400}